            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h2",
              "content": "What is Building Changes?"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Building Changes is a non-profit dedicated to tackling homelessness at the systems level in Washington state. Initially founded in response to homelessness from the Seattle AIDS epidemic, they now undertake long-term driven work in research, policy, advocacy, capacity building and grant making. They focus on the intersection of systems&ndash;education, employment, social and health services&ndash;to sustainably and equitably empower people to achieve housing stability."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "paddingTop": "l",
