            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h2",
              "content": "The Project"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Redesign and develop Building Changes' website to better communicate who they are and what they do as an evolving organization."
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "The Brief"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Context"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "Building Changes was in a state of transition. They were in the process of revising their vision, mission and values, merging Schoolhouse Washington (student homelessness project) into their brand and reducing their grant making programs because of changes in funding. Their existing site was outdated, difficult to navigate and presented a narrative at odds with their new strategic direction around policy and advocacy."
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Users"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "ul",
              "content": [
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Primary"
                    },
                    {
                      "content": " &ndash; housing and homeless service providers like shelters as well as school districts and school staff"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "tag": "strong",
                      "content": "Secondary"
                    },
                    {
                      "content": " &ndash; advocates and policymakers like state legislators and housing/health nonprofits and advocacy groups"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Goals"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "ul",
              "content": [
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": "Reflect shift towards policy and advocacy work (and away from grant making)"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": "Improve site engagement&ndash;page views, bounce rates and overall traffic"
                },
                {
                  "tag": "li",
                  "content": "Merge Schoolhouse Washington into Building Changes"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Guiding Keywords"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "From this brief and interviews with stakeholders we captured these keywords to use as our focus throughout all phases of the project: "
            }
          ]
        },
