              "content": "The Process"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "Wireframes"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": "With the homepage, we focused on better communicating what Building Changes does in the above the fold area by priority&ndash;housing, education and health. As well as including resources. Stakeholders highlighted how important resources are to their primary user group and how it serves as an entry point for many site visitors. The new layout offers flexible display and discoverability across multiple resource types and jointly helps reflect their shift towards policy work. Moreover, as they would be relying on donations in the future, we decided to make it more prominent in the main navigation."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
