          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h3",
              "content": "Visual Design"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "UI Design"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "Bold and modern were our anchoring principles. Unique polygon background shapes nod to their logo, an intentional motif rather than a decorative one. Asymmetrical layouts, justified buttons and hero offsets create a sense of dynamism that speaks to a modern, evolving organization pushing against the status quo. We were careful not to let these devices overwhelm the site's clarity: ample negative space and clean, legible typography keep information easy to scan and digest. A bolder use of colour sharpens visual hierarchy too, reserved for specific sections like the work pillars so it continues to guide attention rather than dilute it."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
