              "content": "Style Tile"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "Not every page or surface warranted a full high-fidelity mockup, so we built a style tile: a contained, at-a-glance design system covering colours, typography as well as buttons, form elements, cards and other key components and sections. It gave the Building Changes team the building blocks to extend the new visual language consistently to any surface we hadn't designed directly."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
