        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "maxWidth": "xs",
          "richTextStyles": true,
          "content": [
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "h4",
              "content": "Diagram"
            },
            {
              "renderType": "richText",
              "tag": "p",
              "content": [
                {
                  "content": "We were also tasked with creating a visual that could express their new direction as an organization at a glance, with racial equity front and center. We designed custom icons for each core value in a circular diagram, a form that shows how each value informs the next and reinforces the fact that this work is ongoing."
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "renderType": "container",
          "paddingTop": "l",
          "paddingTopLarge": "2xl",
          "tag": "figure",
          "content": [
