        {
          "renderType": "richText",
          "tag": "h2",
          "content": "The Outcome"
        },
        {
          "renderType": "richText",
          "tag": "p",
          "content": [
            {
              "content": "Stakeholders were pleased with the result, noting how much clearer and more cohesive Building Changes' message and identity felt on the new site. The data backed that up: while overall traffic dipped in the months after launch, engagement improved substantially. Pages per visit more than "
            },
            {
              "tag": "strong",
              "content": "doubled"
            },
            {
              "content": ", visitors spent nearly "
            },
            {
              "tag": "strong",
              "content": "10 times longer"
            },
            {
              "content": " on the site on average and bounce rate "
            },
            {
              "tag": "strong",
              "content": "dropped by more than 40%"
            },
            {
              "content": ", all indicating that visitors were engaging far more deeply with the content once they found it."
            }
          ]
        },
